<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Rowan Cos cut to hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Rowan Cos cut to hold.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Prudential Securities has cut its rating for Rowan Cos Inc to hold from buy, a Prudential source said on Thursday.</p>
<p>-- The company's shares fell 3/8 to 28-1/8 in early trade.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
